00:47:16.010 --> 00:47:31.070
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>I wondered if Banias had seen those images, but I didn't ask. Instead, we watched this Christmas movie. We watched Kevin trick the burglars into thinking his family is home by staging a fake party in his house.
